// SNIPPET — merge into your host tsconfig.json `exclude` array.
//
// Why (PLAYBOOK §D):
// Next.js's `next build` type-checks every TS file it can reach, which by
// default includes the vendored sub-apps. palace-inner ships an older csstype
// inside its own node_modules; host has a newer csstype; the two
// React.CSSProperties types diverge and `Link.tsx` blows up. The vendor
// sub-apps have their own tsconfig + build pipeline — Next.js root has no
// business type-checking them.

{
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules",
    "palace-outer",
    "palace-inner"
  ]
}
